le="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;"><strong>' + (eL || '—') + '</strong></td></tr></table>' + videoHtmlD + '<p style="margin:28px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#718096;">Automated message from MediFollow.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>';
